[For "white"]
[Kind "gambit"]
[Start "london-englund 2.dxe5"]
[Name "The Englund: 2...d6"]

2... d6 { Black gives the pawn for open lines. }
3. exd6 { Takes. Black gets a bishop out in return, but a pawn is a pawn. }
3... Bxd6
4. Nc3 { Develops towards the centre, and heads for b5. }
4... Nf6
5. Nb5 { Hits the d6 bishop, the one piece Black has to show for the pawn. If it stays, White gets the two bishops on top of the extra pawn. [%cal Gb5d6] } *
